# Restrict the build context to the worker's explicit build inputs; the repo
# root also holds node_modules and the Node worker's sources.
**
!assessment-worker/
!assessment-worker/requirements.txt
!assessment-worker/src/
!assessment-worker/src/**
!docs/
!docs/assessment/
!docs/assessment/contracts/
!docs/assessment/contracts/**
# Never include local secrets or interpreter state, even under an allowed path.
**/.env*
**/*.pem
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.DS_Store
